\f0\fs30 \cf10 Hi Pascal,\
I'm an engineering student at Arts et M\'e9tiers, also pursuing a Research Master's in Advanced Systems & Robotics at Sorbonne Universit\'e9. I'm looking for a six-month, full-time internship starting in February 2027, and Binabik's work on making humanoid robots useful in real industrial environments caught my attention!\
What particularly interests me is how your team brings together robot learning, perception, and software integration to make robots perform real-world tasks. I'd love to contribute to that process, especially the challenge of turning algorithms into reliable behavior on physical robots.\
During my research project in Paris and internship in Singapore (PIMM / CNRS@CREATE), I worked with another student on a mobile robot combining trajectory planning, overhead-camera ArUco localization, and feedback control. I reduced mean calibration-grid localization error by 84%. I really enjoyed going from reading papers and developing algorithms to actually making a robot work! The project also led to a manuscript, which I'm the first author of and is currently under journal review. ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://slimaneaouanouk.com/paco-showcase/index.html"}}{\fldrslt \cf11 project breakdown & videos here}})\
I'd especially love to contribute to robotics software development, whether through perception, navigation, robot integration, or testing and validation on real hardware. I'm currently studying state estimation and SLAM, and I'd be excited to build on my experience with camera-based localization and physical experiments.\
I'm also working on a Unitree G1 VLA project, targeting teleoperated demonstrations and OpenPI policy fine-tuning for assistive manipulation. I'd be happy to explore robot learning opportunities as well, or other roles where my background could be useful.\
Since this is my final year, I want to learn as fast as possible while contributing to a real product. I'd love to work closely with the team, give my best during the internship, and hopefully stay afterward if it's a good fit!\
Could there be a suitable internship opportunity, and would you be open to a brief discussion?\
My CV is attached, and you can also find more of my projects on my portfolio: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://slimaneaouanouk.com/"}}{\fldrslt \cf11 https://slimaneaouanouk.com}}.\
Best regards, \
Slimane AOUANOUK \
